00:15:55,344 --> 00:15:57,796
就是这里的这一段。
It is this one right here.

243
00:15:58,464 --> 00:16:01,024
这里最容易出问题的地方。
Where this is likely to go wrong.

244
00:16:01,294 --> 00:16:02,596
得好好读一下这一条。
Read this one properly.

245
00:16:02,990 --> 00:16:08,804
因为风险不在于导入解析失败，而在于它会静默失败。
Because the risk isn't about import resolution fails, it is that it fails silently.

246
00:16:09,518 --> 00:16:12,580
你可以看一个接口，判断它是否坏了。
You can look at an interface and see if it's broken.

247
00:16:13,486 --> 00:16:17,796
但你没法通过看一张图，就判断它是不是丢了一半的边。
You cannot look at a graph and tell whether it's missing half its edges.

248
00:16:19,022 --> 00:16:22,916
一个损坏的解析器会生成一张漂亮的图片，而且不报错。
A broken parser renders a beautiful picture and throws nothing.

249
00:16:23,534 --> 00:16:27,264
