00:18:01,024 --> 00:18:05,744
大多数规则文件是告诉智能体要构建什么，但这个文件是告诉它该如何表现。
Most rule files tell the agent what to build, but this one tells it how to behave.

272
00:18:05,984 --> 00:18:09,984
只问一个具体问题，并说明你会怎么做以及原因。
Ask one specific question and say which way you'd go and why.

273
00:18:10,158 --> 00:18:14,052
如果含义模糊，只需提问，但要带上你的建议答案。
If it is ambiguous, simply ask, but bring an answer with you.

274
00:18:14,670 --> 00:18:15,972
选 A 还是 B？
A or B?

275
00:18:17,198 --> 00:18:19,492
我选 B，因为它能让解析器保持独立。
I take B because it keeps the parser stand alone.

276
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:25,188
这样只需两秒就能回复，而开放式问题会导致构建中断。
It takes two seconds to reply, as opposed to an open question that just stops the build.

277
00:18:26,030 --> 00:18:28,944
另外，我告诉它不要写大段文字。
Also, I told it no walls of text.

278
00:18:29,230 --> 00:18:33,424
使用通俗的英语，如果需要密钥，说明具体的名称和位置，然后就停止。
Use plain English, if it needs a key, say exactly what and where, and stop.

279
00:18:33,584 --> 00:18:36,624
哦，还有一个叫「禁止事项」的章节。
Oh, and there's also a section called things not to do.

280
00:18:37,038 --> 00:18:38,704
我觉得就在下面这里。
I think it is right here below.

281
00:18:38,926 --> 00:18:41,988
因为违反其中任何一项都比没完成任务要糟糕。
Because breaking one of these is worse than not finishing.

282
00:18:42,224 --> 00:18:44,452
这些是会导致产品崩溃的事情。
These are the things that break the product.

283
00:18:44,718 --> 00:18:48,996
智能体的特点是，它们几乎每次都会做看似合理的决策。
The thing about agents is that they'll do the reasonable thing almost every time.

284
00:18:49,454 --> 00:18:54,144
但问题是，一些最糟糕的决定看起来也完全合理。
But the problem is that some of the worst decisions you can make look completely reasonable.

285
00:18:54,304 --> 00:18:58,372
例如，根据文件名来推测一条边是合理的。
For example, guessing an edge from a file name is reasonable.

286
00:18:58,606 --> 00:19:02,532
展示一个可能的路径而不是真实的路径也是合理的。
Showing a probable route instead of a real route is reasonable.

287
00:19:02,990 --> 00:19:07,236
为了让输出看起来完整而填补空白，也非常合理。
And filling a gap so the output looks complete is extremely reasonable.

288
00:19:07,822 --> 00:19:13,572
所以这不是我在告诉它该做什么，而是告诉它哪些看似合理的做法在这里是错误的。
So this isn't me telling it what to do. It's telling it which reasonable things are wrong here.

289
00:19:13,904 --> 00:19:17,904
例如，永远不要判定两个文件是连接的。
For example, never decide that two files are connected.

290
00:19:18,126 --> 00:19:27,076
边之所以存在，是因为解析器将真实的导入解析到了真实的文件，而不是因为文件名、惯例或合理的推测。
An edge exists because the parser resolved a real import to a real file, not because of a file name, a convention, or a reasonable guess.

291
00:19:27,726 --> 00:19:30,464
这不只是风格规则，而是整个产品的基础。
It's not just a style rule, it's the whole product.

292
00:19:30,734 --> 00:19:35,236
如果模型去猜测哪些文件互相导入，那么这个图就是虚构的。
If the model gets to guess which files import each other, the graph is fiction.

