1049
01:21:14,576 --> 01:21:17,924
我们还在引入“洞察”这个概念。
And we're also introducing a concept of insights.

1050
01:21:18,414 --> 01:21:27,056
我们直接从图中检测出一些有用的信息，比如导入循环、没有任何人导入的文件、高度依赖于某些文件的文件等。
We're detecting a few useful things directly from the graph, such as import cycles, files that nothing imports, heavily dependent on files,

1051
01:21:27,216 --> 01:21:31,908
还有那些体积异常庞大的文件。一旦你看到可视化效果，这些都会变得清晰明了。
and files that have grown unusually large. It'll all start making sense once you see it visually.

1052
01:21:32,206 --> 01:21:38,884
如果你滚动到限制部分，你可以看到这里：一个没有任何文件导入的文件并不自动被视为孤儿文件。
And if you scroll to the constraints section, you can see here that a file that nothing imports is not automatically an orphan.

1053
01:21:39,342 --> 01:21:41,188
这个区别很重要。
And that distinction matters.

1054
01:21:41,870 --> 01:21:50,276
页面、路由、布局或中间件文件可能根本没被其他文件导入，但框架本身知道如何使用它们。
A page, route, layout, or middleware file may not be imported by another file at all, but the framework itself knows how to use it.

1055
01:21:51,086 --> 01:21:56,816
所以我们不能看到零导入指向这些文件就自动把它们标记为未使用的文件。
So we can't look at zero imports pointing here files and automatically call those files unused.

1056
01:21:57,230 --> 01:22:02,372
否则，我们就把依赖图的一个局限性当成了代码库中的问题。
Otherwise, we'd be treating a limitation of our dependency graph as a problem in the codebase.

1057
01:22:02,798 --> 01:22:05,380
