1104
01:25:29,102 --> 01:25:36,352
所以我们来提交并推送它，然后开一个新分支和 PR。
So let's just commit and push it and open up a new branch and a PR.

1105
01:25:36,590 --> 01:25:39,072
我们暂时不会把这个 PR 合并到主分支。
We won't yet go ahead and merge this PR to main.

1106
01:25:39,312 --> 01:25:48,164
相反，我们会开启几个 PR，以便稍后我们可以利用 CodeRabbit 的分拣功能来决定优先处理哪一个。
Rather, we'll open up a couple of PRs so that later on we can explore CodeRabbit's triage functionality to see which one should we prioritize.

1107
01:25:48,526 --> 01:25:51,780
第六阶段已提交、推送并创建了 PR。
Phase 6 committed, pushed, and the PR opened.

1108
01:25:53,646 --> 01:25:59,652
到目前为止，我们构建的所有功能都是基于我们手动放入项目中的仓库数据。
Everything we've built so far has been working against repository data that we put into the project ourselves.

1109
01:26:00,270 --> 01:26:02,948
现在我们要用一个真实的流程来替换它。
Now we're replacing that with a real flow.

1110
01:26:03,534 --> 01:26:11,392
我们希望能够粘贴一个 GitHub URL，获取仓库，解析它，存储结果，并直接跳转到地图界面。
We want to be able to paste a GitHub URL, fetch the repo, parse it, store the result, and take us straight to the map.

1111
01:26:11,566 --> 01:26:16,512
一旦这个搞定，我们一直在用的临时解析器输出就可以彻底移除。
Once that works, the temporary parser output that we've been using can finally go away.

1112
01:26:16,672 --> 01:26:19,472
为此，我们将使用第 07 阶段。
For that, we'll use the phase 07

1113
01:26:20,750 --> 01:26:25,380
目标是粘贴一个 URL 后，就能看到自己的仓库变成一张地图。
with the goal of pasting a URL and watching your own repository become a map.

1114
01:26:25,632 --> 01:26:32,192
这里的流水线包含四个主要阶段：获取、选择、解析和存储。
The pipeline here has four main stages fetch, select, parse, and store.

1115
01:26:32,494 --> 01:26:38,948
我们以归档形式获取公开仓库，所以不需要仓库权限，也不需要存储 GitHub 令牌。
We fetch public repositories as archives, so we don't need repository permissions or need to store a GitHub token.

1116
01:26:39,072 --> 01:26:44,996
我们还会保留产生分析结果的提交记录，因为后续我们需要知道仓库是否发生了变化。
We also keep the commit the analysis came from, because later we'll need to know if the repository has changed.

1117
01:26:45,472 --> 01:26:49,392
而且我们只希望每个仓库对应一个分析结果。
And we only want to have one analysis per repository.

1118
01:26:49,678 --> 01:26:57,444
如果你粘贴的仓库已经分析过，或者组织里的其他人已经分析过了，我们就没必要创建另一个副本。
If you paste the repo you've already analyzed, or that somebody from your organization has already analyzed, we don't need to create another copy.

1119
01:26:57,712 --> 01:26:59,908
我们会直接带你进入现有的那个。
We immediately take you to the existing one.

1120
01:27:00,590 --> 01:27:05,872
如果你真的想重新运行一遍，那是在分析页面里进行的独立操作。
And if you want to actually rerun it, well, that's a separate action from inside the analysis.

1121
01:27:06,094 --> 01:27:08,708
按照惯例，我们也要看看一些限制条件。
As usual, let's also explore the constraints.

1122
01:27:09,774 --> 01:27:14,352
实时进度是由数据库驱动的，而不是通过浏览器轮询。
Live progress is driven from the database, not from browser polling.

1123
01:27:14,734 --> 01:27:20,836
随着流水线从一个阶段进入下一个阶段，数据库会发布该变化，页面会监听这个变化。
As the pipeline moves from one stage to the next, the database publishes that change and the page listens for it.

1124
01:27:21,422 --> 01:27:24,580
所以浏览器不需要不断地去问：‘还没做完吗？’
So the browser isn't constantly asking, are we done yet?

1125
01:27:24,752 --> 01:27:28,752
此外，在任何内容发布到频道之前，必须先声明该通道。
Also, the channel has to be declared before anything can publish to it.

1126
01:27:28,942 --> 01:27:30,788
这一点很容易被忽略。
And this is an easy one to miss.

1127
01:27:31,374 --> 01:27:38,148
如果实时通道没有正确注册，流水线可能一直在运行，但进度页面却永远收不到通知。
If the real-time channel isn't registered properly, the pipeline can keep running while the progress page never hears about it.

1128
01:27:38,414 --> 01:27:44,352
所以我们需要在迁移中定义该通道，而不是指望它能自动存在。
So we need to define that channel as part of the migration instead of relying on it to magically exist.

1129
01:27:44,654 --> 01:27:47,332
谁有权订阅也是一项政策。
And who may subscribe is also a policy.

1130
01:27:48,014 --> 01:27:54,212
出于同样的原因，其他组织的分析通道是不可订阅的，就像它们的行数据不可选一样。
Another organization's analysis channel is not subscribable for the same reason its rows aren't selectable.

1131
01:27:54,638 --> 01:27:58,192
进度流的保护机制与数据的保护方式相同。
The progress stream is protected the same way that the data is.

1132
01:27:58,446 --> 01:28:02,884
一个团队不应该能够订阅另一个团队的分析进度。
One team shouldn't be able to subscribe to another team's analysis progress.

1133
01:28:03,072 --> 01:28:07,204
此外，那些没有报错就中断的任务也必须可见。
Also, a run that dies without failing has to be visible too.

1134
01:28:07,726 --> 01:28:10,372
我们需要处理两种不同的失败情况。
We need to handle two different failure cases.

1135
01:28:10,830 --> 01:28:14,148
如果流水线抛出错误，我们需要记录发生了什么。
If the pipeline throws an error, we need to record what happens.

1136
01:28:14,574 --> 01:28:19,072
但如果进程在执行到一半时就消失了，可能根本就没有可捕获的错误。
But if the process disappears halfway through, there may be no error to catch at all.

1137
01:28:19,342 --> 01:28:26,180
因此，如果一个任务长时间处于未完成状态，仪表盘会将其标记为过期，而不是假装它仍在运行。
So if a run stays unfinished for too long, the dashboard marks it as stale instead of pretending that it's still working.

1138
01:28:26,894 --> 01:28:30,352
这是一个相当大的阶段，所以我打算分两次来构建。
This is a pretty big phase, so I'm going to build it in two passes.

1139
01:28:30,638 --> 01:28:36,592
让我们打开智能体，并让它去阅读 Clotmd、文档规范以及第 07 阶段。
Let's open up the agent and tell it to read Clotmd and docs specs phase 07.

1140
01:28:37,582 --> 01:28:44,644
我们想先从获取仓库开始，将其通过解析器存入数据库，暂时还没有 UI。
And we want to start with fetching a repo and running it through the parser into storage with no UI yet.

1141
01:28:45,072 --> 01:28:46,788
那是我们稍后要做的事情。
That we're going to do later on.

1142
01:28:47,918 --> 01:28:51,748
所以先运行它，看看在构建之前它有没有什么问题问我们。
So let's run it and let's see if it has any questions for us before it builds it.

1143
01:28:51,920 --> 01:28:54,308
在构建之前，有三件事需要我们做决定。
Before building, three things need our decision.

1144
01:28:54,894 --> 01:28:57,124
写入器、包，以及查看行。
Writer, package, and see the rows.

1145
01:28:57,520 --> 01:29:00,836
首先，运行程序应该如何写入数据行？
First, how should the run write rows?

1146
01:29:01,200 --> 01:29:07,300
Clerk 会话令牌的有效期只有 60 秒，而真实的仓库解析完成前请求就已经超时了。
A clerk session token lasts 60 seconds, and the request is over before a real repo finished parsing.

1147
01:29:07,520 --> 01:29:10,400
所以使用用户的令牌无法支撑整个运行过程。
So writing with a user's token won't last the whole run.

1148
01:29:10,766 --> 01:29:14,788
我会使用仅限服务器写入模块的 Superbase 密钥。
I'd use the Superbase Secret key kept to the server-only writer module.

1149
01:29:14,990 --> 01:29:21,188
当你提交时，组织 ID 仍来自会话令牌，且每次读取都符合现有策略。
The org ID still comes from the session token when you submit, and every read stays under the existing policies.

1150
01:29:21,520 --> 01:29:32,560
这很重要，因为这与我们目前构建的面向用户的数据库请求不同，这个请求需要在后台向服务器写入大量的分析数据。
This is important because there's a difference from the user-facing database requests that we've built so far and this one, which needs to write a lot of analysis data in the background to the server.

1151
01:29:32,814 --> 01:29:37,764
因此它使用的是服务端密钥，而不是已登录用户的浏览器会话。
So it uses a server-side secret credential rather than the signed-in user's browser session.

1152
01:29:38,254 --> 01:29:44,640
这意味着流水线本身必须非常小心，确保将正确的组织信息附加到所有写入的内容中。
That means that the pipeline itself has to be very careful to attach the correct organization to everything it writes.

1153
01:29:44,942 --> 01:29:49,360
为了实现这一点，我们必须把 Superbase 密钥添加到 ENVLocal 中。
So for this to work, we have to add the Superbase Secret Key to ENVLocal.

1154
01:29:49,550 --> 01:29:52,804
所以去 Superbase，在你的项目下，
So head over to Superbase, under your project,

1155
01:29:53,520 --> 01:29:55,076
进入设置，
go under settings,

1156
01:29:55,886 --> 01:29:56,996
API，密钥，
API, keys,

1157
01:29:57,680 --> 01:29:59,076
滚动到最底部。
scroll to the bottom.

1158
01:29:59,502 --> 01:30:02,628
在秘密密钥下，你可以复制这个 API 密钥
and under secret keys, you can copy this API key

1159
01:30:03,600 --> 01:30:09,920
然后进入 .env.local 并按照这里要求的格式粘贴进去。
and head over into.env.local and paste it as it says right. here.

1160
01:30:10,222 --> 01:30:12,196
它会放在 Superbase 下面。
That's going to be under Superbase.

1161
01:30:12,400 --> 01:30:15,440
而且它要求我们称之为 Superbase Secret Key。
And it told us to call it Superbase Secret Key.

1162
01:30:15,520 --> 01:30:16,900
那我就照它说的做。
So that's exactly what I'll do.

1163
01:30:17,422 --> 01:30:20,640
好了，就在这里，在 Superbase 旁边。
There we go, and it's right here at the top beside Superbase.

1164
01:30:20,846 --> 01:30:23,396
所以我们可以说这是我们已经添加的内容。
So we can say this is something that we have already added.

1165
01:30:24,238 --> 01:30:25,040
现在是包。
Now package.

1166
01:30:25,294 --> 01:30:30,340
GitHub 存档是 tar.gzip 格式，而 节点 无法自行解压 tar 包。
GitHub archives are tar.gzip and node can't unpack tar on its own.

1167
01:30:30,670 --> 01:30:32,240
我可以安装 tar 包吗？
Can I install the tar package?

1168
01:30:32,400 --> 01:30:33,444
可以，当然可以。
Yep, definitely.

1169
01:30:33,934 --> 01:30:43,940
关于预填充数据行，预填充中包含两个 Next.js 分析和两个 UI 分析，这破坏了“每个仓库一个分析”的规则，而且这些预填充行背后都没有对应的文件。
And about seeding the rows, the seed has two analyses for Next.js and two for UI that breaks one analysis per repository, and none of the seed rows have files behind them.

1170
01:30:44,334 --> 01:30:48,560
我可以删除这些预填充行，并对每个项目的分析添加唯一约束吗？
Can I delete the seed rows and add a unique constraint on analysis per project?

1171
01:30:48,750 --> 01:30:50,640
是的，这正是我们想要做的。
Yep, that's exactly what we want to do.

1172
01:30:50,830 --> 01:30:57,636
从现在开始，仪表盘只显示真实的分析结果，而且数据库会强制要求每个仓库只能有一个分析。
From this point onward, the dashboard only shows real analyses, and the database enforces one per repo.

1173
01:30:58,414 --> 01:31:05,188
太棒了。我很欢迎这类问题，因为它们能让项目朝着正确的方向发展，而不是让它偏离轨道。
Wonderful. I appreciate these types of questions because they push the project in the right direction instead of derailing it further.

1174
01:31:05,360 --> 01:31:09,316
大约几分钟后，流水线就能在终端正常运行了。
And after about a couple of minutes, the pipeline works from the terminal.

1175
01:31:09,870 --> 01:31:12,036
它测试了所有内容，所以我们不需要手动去测。
It tested everything so we didn't have to.

1176
01:31:12,430 --> 01:31:16,196
获取、选择、解析并存储，写入真实的记录。
Fetch, select, parse, and store, writing real rows.

1177
01:31:16,526 --> 01:31:19,236
目前还没有连接到 UI，所以还没有提交任何内容。
No UI is wired to it yet, so nothing is committed.

1178
01:31:19,758 --> 01:31:20,640
它是端到端运行的。
It runs end-to-end.

1179
01:31:20,960 --> 01:31:25,828
你可以运行 PMPM analyze 并粘贴来自 GitHub 的公开仓库 URL。
You can run PMPM analyze and paste the public repository URL from GitHub.

1180
01:31:25,920 --> 01:31:32,240
它尝试在 Zestan 库上执行，处理了 49 个虚假文件，跳过了 2 个，共 65 条边。
It tried doing that on the Zestan library, 49 farce files, two skip the 65 edges.

1181
01:31:32,400 --> 01:31:32,880
成功了。
It worked.

1182
01:31:33,102 --> 01:31:34,692
它在 Monorepo 上也运行成功了。
It also worked on Monorepo.

1183
01:31:34,960 --> 01:31:41,440
它使用了包含近 10,000 条边的完整 Shats CN UI 库，仅用 18 秒就完成了。
It used the full Shats CN UI library with almost 10,000 edges in 18 seconds.

1184
01:31:41,600 --> 01:31:42,276
太棒了。
That's great.

1185
01:31:42,480 --> 01:31:46,404
它实现了每个仓库一个分析，如果缺少仓库，系统会正常报错。
It's doing one analysis per repo, and a missing repo fails cleanly.

1186
01:31:46,720 --> 01:31:47,108
很好。
Great.

1187
01:31:47,360 --> 01:31:54,212
所以所有这些都已经按预期完成了，接下来的步骤是做 UI。
So all of this is done exactly as it's supposed to, but now the next step is to do the UI.

1188
01:31:54,400 --> 01:32:00,160
现在我们可以让它去制作进度页面和实时通道了。
So we can tell it now do the progress page and the real-time channel.

1189
01:32:00,494 --> 01:32:08,880
这样我们就能在分析仓库时进行可视化展示，并把仪表板上的表单连接起来。
So this is how we'll be able to visualize as it is analyzing the repo and wire up the form on the dashboard.

1190
01:32:09,040 --> 01:32:18,852
这将是下一步。我会在同一个对话历史或同一个聊天中操作，因为我们还在处理同样的东西，只是进入下一个阶段，也就是 UI。
That's going to be the next step. And I'm doing it in the same conversation history or in the same chat because we're still working on the same thing, just the next step, which is the UI.

1191
01:32:19,120 --> 01:32:20,548
那让它开始工作吧。
So let's let it do its thing.

1192
01:32:20,800 --> 01:32:21,840
搞定。
And there we go.

1193
01:32:22,094 --> 01:32:25,988
仪表板表单、进度页面和实时更新都构建完成了。
The dashboard form, the progress page, and live updates are built.

1194
01:32:26,160 --> 01:32:27,600
那我们来测试一下吧。
So let's go ahead and test it.

1195
01:32:27,760 --> 01:32:29,600
首先，我们需要找一个仓库。
First, we need to find a repo.

1196
01:32:29,710 --> 01:32:32,932
也许我们可以从最近的视频中选一个仓库。
And maybe we can pick a repo from one of the recent videos.

1197
01:32:33,200 --> 01:32:42,400
也许是这个视频里的 LLM Arena，我们构建了一个在多个智能体上运行同一个提示词并进行竞速的应用。
Maybe the LLM Arena from this video, where we built an application that runs one prompt against multiple agents and then races them.

1198
01:32:42,560 --> 01:32:46,404
哦，看起来 Tech with Tim 也刚发布了一个关于 Claude Code 的视频。
Oh, and it looks like Tech with Tim just published a clot code video as well.

1199
01:32:46,766 --> 01:32:47,360
挺不错的。
That's nice.

1200
01:32:47,726 --> 01:32:50,480
不过没关系，你可以随意选择任何你有的 GitHub 仓库。
But yeah, feel free to get any GitHub repo that you have.

1201
01:32:50,640 --> 01:32:58,468
我甚至建议你不要用我正在用的这个，而是从你自己的个人主页里选一个你自己开发过的项目。
I would even recommend not using the same one that I'm using right here, but maybe picking something from your own profile, something that you have developed.

1202
01:32:58,830 --> 01:33:05,860
拿到之后，回到你的应用里，你应该能看到现在可以在这里输入 URL 了
Once you have it, go back to your app and you should be able to see that you can now enter a URL right here

1203
01:33:06,720 --> 01:33:08,356
然后点击分析。
and click analyze.

1204
01:33:09,582 --> 01:33:19,236
它会显示正在启动，并把你带到一个专门的页面，按顺序展示获取、选择文件、解析以及存储地图这些步骤。
It'll say starting and it'll move you to a special page that'll move across the steps of fetching, selecting files, parsing, and then storing the map.

1205
01:33:19,758 --> 01:33:20,320
就这样。
And that's it.

1206
01:33:20,622 --> 01:33:21,280
完成了。
It's complete.

1207
01:33:21,550 --> 01:33:26,692
我觉得最后一步它应该把我重定向到完整的分析地图页面。
I think the last thing that it should have done is redirected me to the full map of the analysis.

1208
01:33:26,960 --> 01:33:28,292
但它没这么做。
But it didn't do that.

1209
01:33:28,590 --> 01:33:37,060
所以如果我回到 localhost 并点击 LLM Arena，它只打开了加载过程，而不是真正的地图。
So if I head back on localhost and click on the LLM arena, it only opens up the loading process, but not the actual map.

1210
01:33:37,358 --> 01:33:38,640
这就是我们要告诉它的内容。
So that's what we'll tell it.

1211
01:33:38,800 --> 01:33:48,240
在完成所有步骤，特别是存储地图后，我们应该被重定向到
Upon finishing with all the steps, specifically storing the map, we should be redirected to

1212
01:33:48,560 --> 01:33:52,560
新分析的仓库地图页面。
the map of the newly analyzed repo.

1213
01:33:52,800 --> 01:33:57,040
目前它只是停留在流水线页面。
Currently, it just stays on the pipeline page.

1214
01:33:57,486 --> 01:33:59,492
我觉得这个应该能解决问题。
I believe this one should do the trick.

1215
01:33:59,982 --> 01:34:04,836
这个需要 explorer 去读取存储的行，反正这也是需求规格中的下一个项目。
This one needs the explorer to read the stored rows, which is the next item in the spec anyway.

1216
01:34:05,646 --> 01:34:07,364
所以它会开始执行。
So it'll start implementing it.

1217
01:34:07,760 --> 01:34:16,740
分析 ID 页面在运行完成后会从存储的数据中渲染地图，这让检查预览变得多余了，所以我会按照需求规格把它删掉。
The analyses ID page renders the map from stored data once the run completes, making the check-in preview obsolete, so I'll delete it as the spec requires.

1218
01:34:17,646 --> 01:34:22,564
所以现在，每当我们刷新时，不再看到这个，而是应该能看到地图了。
So now, whenever we reload, instead of seeing this, I believe we should be able to see the map.

1219
01:34:22,800 --> 01:34:26,800
不到一分钟，一个完成的运行任务就会变成一张地图。
And within a minute, a finished run now turns into a map.

1220
01:34:27,182 --> 01:34:35,236
所以当进入存储阶段时，进度页面会刷新，相同的分析 ID 地址会从存储的行中渲染出地图。
So when the store stage lands, the progress page refreshes and the same analysis ID address renders the map from the stored rows.

1221
01:34:36,526 --> 01:34:39,204
好，回到 localhost，看看这个。
So back on localhost, check this out.

1222
