One place in the entire code base that constructs the AI client, wrapped so every call through it is traced, explaining a file

1548
02:02:09,902 --> 02:02:17,060
该文件的内容由其真实的邻近项、它导入的内容以及导入它的内容组成，所有这些都会交给模型。
written from that file's real neighbors, the things it imports, and the things importing it, all of them handed to the model.

1549
02:02:17,294 --> 02:02:21,316
你可能会说，噢，但你现在是让 OpenAI 来解释一个特定的文件。
You could say, oh, but you're now getting OpenAI to explain a specific file.

1550
02:02:21,678 --> 02:02:29,488
是的，但我们将利用完整的解析器、对应用程序的了解以及该应用目前拥有的代码库地图来驱动它。
Well, yes, but we're going to power it with the full parser and the knowledge of the application and the map of the code base that this application now has.

1551
02:02:29,710 --> 02:02:38,980
同样的情况也适用于解释文件夹或为任何适配器都无法识别的文件分配角色。两者都会有一个基于被解释内容作为键的缓存。
Same thing goes for explaining folders or assigning roles to files that no adapter could identify. A cache for both keyed on the content of the thing being explained.

1552
02:02:39,248 --> 02:02:42,608
并且已经获取的解释会保留在面板中。
And an explanation already fetched stays in the pane.

1553
02:02:42,862 --> 02:02:46,660
你已经知道我们正在构建的主要功能了，所以我不会重复这些内容。
You already know the main feature we're building here, so I won't repeat all of that.

1554
02:02:47,008 --> 02:02:49,604
但围绕它有一个重要的部分。
But there's one important piece around it.

1555
02:02:50,222 --> 02:02:50,848
缓存。
Caching.

1556
02:02:51,470 --> 02:02:57,568
一旦我们解释了文件，就不希望在你点击离开再回来时每次都重新调用模型。
Once we've explained the file, we don't want to call the model again every time you click away and come back.

1557
02:02:57,774 --> 02:03:01,188
所以我们根据文件的内容来缓存解释。
So we cache the explanation based on the file's content.

1558
02:03:01,582 --> 02:03:05,412
如果文件没有变化，我们可以立即重用该解释。
If the file hasn't changed, we can reuse the explanation instantly.

1559
02:03:05,710 --> 02:03:10,660
如果内容发生了变化，缓存就不再匹配，我们会生成一个新的。
And if the content changes, the cache no longer matches and we generate a fresh one.

1560
02:03:10,926 --> 02:03:13,088
我们这样做并不是为了减少调用次数。
We do that not to rack up the calls.

1561
02:03:13,294 --> 02:03:15,328
现在我们快速看一下一些限制条件。
Now let's take a quick look at the constraints.

1562
02:03:15,502 --> 02:03:26,884
重点是，缓存读取必须发生在追踪调用内部，而不是在它之前。即使答案来自缓存，我们仍希望请求能显示在 Langsmith 中。
The important part is that the cache read happens inside a traced call, not before it. And even when the answer comes from the cache, we still want the request to appear in Langsmith.

1563
02:03:27,406 --> 02:03:33,892
区别在于，如果发生缓存命中，应该显示一个没有模型调用且没有消耗模型 token 的追踪运行。
The difference is that a cache hit should show a trace run with no model call and no model tokens used.

1564
02:03:34,830 --> 02:03:39,808
这样我们就能真正验证缓存是否在起作用，而不仅仅是凭感觉去假设。
That way we can actually verify that the cache is working instead of just assuming it is.

1565
02:03:39,968 --> 02:03:42,660
考虑到这些，让我们开始构建吧。
