02:33:18,670 --> 02:33:20,548
Claude Code 不仅仅是执行了它。
Claude code didn't just apply it.

1912
02:33:20,942 --> 02:33:24,772
它还检查了我的 ENV 是否真的使用了变量扩展。
It checked whether my ENV actually uses variable expansion.

1913
02:33:25,646 --> 02:33:28,772
发现没有，并给出了理由跳过了修复。
Saw that it doesn't, and skipped the fix with a reason.

1914
02:33:28,976 --> 02:33:30,244
这就是整个游戏的精髓。
And that's the whole game.

1915
02:33:30,670 --> 02:33:33,476
评审意见是输入信息，而不是指令。
Review comments are inputs and not orders.

1916
02:33:33,776 --> 02:33:38,436
智能体根据仓库内容验证了发现项并拒绝了它。
The agent verified a finding against the repo and rejected it.

1917
02:33:38,736 --> 02:33:41,028
因为它不是这个项目的正确修复方案。
Because it wasn't the right fix for this project.

1918
02:33:41,230 --> 02:33:45,536
我们现在快要完成这个了不起的项目了。
And we're now close to the end of building this amazing project.

1919
02:33:45,776 --> 02:33:48,676
这在以前可能需要几个月才能构建出来的东西。
Something that before would take months to build.

1920
02:33:48,976 --> 02:33:50,884
我们现在只是在下午就把它做出来了。
We just built it in the afternoon.

1921
02:33:51,536 --> 02:33:59,296
但这一部分，也就是审查、验证、决定哪些问题真正值得修复，这才是现在核心的工作。
But this part, the review, the verification, deciding what's actually worth fixing, that's the real job now.

1922
02:33:59,598 --> 02:34:03,536
换句话说，瓶颈从“编写”转移到了“校验”。
In other words, the bottleneck moved from writing to validating.

1923
02:34:03,694 --> 02:34:05,536
而这正是 Code Rabbit 发挥作用的地方。
And that's exactly where Code Rabbit sits.

1924
02:34:05,806 --> 02:34:09,860
它会读取每一个差异，所以永远不需要问：有人看过这段代码吗？
It reads every diff, so the question is never, did anyone look at this?

1925
02:34:10,222 --> 02:34:14,820
相反，我们要关注的是审查发现了什么，以及我们该如何处理。
Rather, it's what did the review find, and what do we do about it?

1926
02:34:15,086 --> 02:34:23,524
在这一阶段之前，我们可以检查特定文件的解释，比如点到这里，然后判断它看起来是否没问题。
Now, before this phase, we could inspect an explanation on a specific file, like heading over right here, and decide whether it looked good.

1927
02:34:24,078 --> 02:34:34,096
但现在我们可以真正衡量一些指标，比如它是否编造了路径、它对角色的分类准确度如何，以及新的提示词是否比之前的更好。
But now we can actually measure things like whether it invents paths, how accurately it classifies roles, and whether a new prompt performs better than the previous one.

1928
02:34:34,254 --> 02:34:39,204
有了这些基础，我们就可以进入我们要构建的最后一个核心功能了。
And with that in place, we are ready for the last major feature that we've been building toward.

1929
02:34:39,950 --> 02:34:40,740
就是智能体。
The agent.

1930
02:34:43,022 --> 02:34:44,868
没错，就是这个。
Right, this is the one.

1931
02:34:45,134 --> 02:34:53,828
在最开始的时候，我说过我们大多数人只是调用了 AI API，并称之为“利用 AI 构建”，但那其实只是打了个电话而已，
Way back at the start, I said that most of us have called an AI API, and we call that building with AI, whereas that was just a phone call,

1932
02:34:54,176 --> 02:34:54,896
而不是一个智能体。
not an agent.

1933
02:34:55,150 --> 02:34:56,964
然后我说过，我们会回到这个话题上的。
And then I said we'd come back to it.

1934
02:34:57,456 --> 02:34:58,816
现在就是那个阶段。
This is that phase.

1935
02:34:59,054 --> 02:35:01,796
打开需求说明的第 12 阶段。
Open up phase 12 of the specifications.

1936
02:35:02,606 --> 02:35:09,444
这里的目标是让用户能够向仓库提问，并看着它去查找答案。
The goal in this case is to allow the users to ask the repository a question and watch it look up the answer.

1937
02:35:10,414 --> 02:35:12,932
这一阶段的内容太多了，所以我们要把它拆分一下。
This is a lot for one phase, so we're going to split it.

1938
02:35:13,230 --> 02:35:20,708
先是工具和智能体本身，然后是 API 和它的凭证，接着是聊天面板，最后是评估。
The tools and the agent itself first, and then the API and its credentials, then the chat panel, and then the evaluation.

1939
02:35:21,038 --> 02:35:29,860
这个智能体将获得六种工具：整个分析的摘要、按路径片段搜索文件、按角色列出文件，
The agent will get six tools a summary of the whole analysis, searching files by part of a path, listing files by role,

1940
02:35:30,256 --> 02:35:35,620
文件的直接邻居、双向的传递性遍历，以及路由表。
direct neighbors of a file, a transitive walk in either direction, and the route table.

1941
02:35:35,950 --> 02:35:39,972
这些工具调用的是绘制画布时用的相同图函数。
These tools call the same graph functions that draw the canvas.

1942
02:35:40,334 --> 02:35:42,532
它们不需要重新实现任何内容。
They do not re implement any of it.

1943
02:35:43,950 --> 02:35:45,156
这一点非常重要。
And that part matters.

1944
02:35:45,536 --> 02:35:50,148
智能体不应该有自己版本的“影响范围”或“依赖遍历”。
The agent shouldn't have its own version of the Blast Radius or dependency traversal.

1945
02:35:50,574 --> 02:35:54,756
它使用的是与应用程序其他部分或信任机制相同的图逻辑。
It uses the same graph logic that the rest of the application or the trusts.

1946
02:35:55,310 --> 02:36:03,332
但基本上，我们希望有一个作为独立服务的智能体项目，而不是运行在应用内部，它是基于托管的深度智能体构建的，
But basically, we want to have an agent project that runs as its own service, not inside of the application, built on managed deep agents,

1947
02:36:03,616 --> 02:36:06,276
在本地运行，通过 HTTP 进行通信。
ran locally, reached over HTTP.

1948
02:36:06,734 --> 02:36:12,016
运行时环境提供了服务器、线程和流式传输，所以这些都不需要手动编写。
The runtime provides a server, the threads, and the streaming, so none of these get written by hand.

1949
02:36:12,270 --> 02:36:19,780
它的指令包含了拒绝行为和“严禁推断”规则，因为这些是产品的规则，而不是智能体的配置。
Its instructions carry the refusal behavior and the never infer rule, because those are the product's rules rather than the agent's configuration.

1950
02:36:20,238 --> 02:36:26,976
如果你去看约束条件，你会发现这个约束完全是关于凭证的。
And if you head over to the constraints, you'll see that this constraint is all about credentials.

1951
02:36:27,246 --> 02:36:28,996
这是一个重要的安全问题。
It's an important security problem.

1952
02:36:29,776 --> 02:36:34,404
我们的智能体正在读取我们无法控制的仓库中的源代码。
Our agent is reading source code from the repositories that we don't control.

1953
02:36:34,990 --> 02:36:40,548
而且源代码可能包含任意文本，甚至包括试图操纵模型的指令。
And source code can contain arbitrary text, even including instructions trying to manipulate the model.

1954
02:36:41,166 --> 02:36:45,316
所以我们绝不允许模型自行选择它有权访问哪些分析。
So we never let the model choose which analysis it has access to.

1955
02:36:45,870 --> 02:36:49,604
这些信息保存在一个短效签名凭证中。
That information lives inside a short-lived signed credential.

1956
02:36:50,158 --> 02:36:57,252
智能体可以向工具提问，但不能因为某些源代码注释的指令就简单地切换到另一个分析。
The agent can ask the tools questions, but it can't simply switch to another analysis because some source code comment told it to.

1957
02:36:58,382 --> 02:37:02,788
而且我们也不会给智能体一个可以读取所有分析的密钥。
And we also don't give the agent a key that can read every analysis.

1958
02:37:03,118 --> 02:37:08,420
工具的作用范围仅限于该对话所属的组织和分析。
The tools stay scope to the organization and analysis that the conversation belongs to.

1959
02:37:08,782 --> 02:37:15,300
现在还记得我们运行 Langsmith 时，它创建了一个名为 my first 智能体 的另一个智能体吗？
Now remember when we ran Langsmith and it created another agent called my first agent.

1960
02:37:16,014 --> 02:37:20,100
好，把那个文件夹移动到这个应用里。
Well, go ahead and move that folder into this application.

1961
02:37:20,718 --> 02:37:23,460
你只需要把它拖到这里
You can do that by simply drag and dropping it right here

1962
02:37:24,206 --> 02:37:25,856
然后说“复制文件夹”。
and say copy folder.

1963
02:37:26,096 --> 02:37:31,684
你可以保留 my first 智能体 这个名字，或者把它重命名为类似 deep 智能体 之类的名称。
You can keep the name my first agent or rename it to something like deep agent.

1964
02:37:32,878 --> 02:37:37,764
所以现在我们实际上是在设置 Langsmith 时创建的那个智能体基础上进行构建。
So now we're actually building on top of the agent that we created while setting up Langsmith.

1965
02:37:38,318 --> 02:37:47,456
现在打开一个新的 Claude Code 窗口，给它一些基础信息，比如 Cartograph 中有一个 deep 智能体 脚手架
So go ahead and open up a new clot code window and give it some baseline information, such as that there's a deep agent scaffold in cartograph

1966
02:37:47,616 --> 02:37:47,972
智能体。
agent.

1967
02:37:48,206 --> 02:37:53,220
现在想想，这个名字对于这个专门针对 Cartograph 的智能体来说要好得多
And now that I think about it, that's a much better name for this cartograph specific agent

1968
02:37:53,966 --> 02:37:57,956
来自之前的 Langsmith 设置，而且 Langsmith 的技能已经安装好了。
from the Langsmith setup earlier, and the Langsmith skills are already installed.

1969
02:37:58,254 --> 02:38:06,852
下一个目标是读取 ClaudeMD 和 Phase 12MD，并在那个脚手架上构建智能体项目及其六个工具。
The next goal will be to read the ClaudeMD and Phase 12MD and build the agent project and its six tools on top of that scaffold.

1970
02:38:07,150 --> 02:38:08,816
我们的应用目前还没有内容。
Nothing in our app yet.

1971
02:38:09,102 --> 02:38:13,508
运行它，让它为我们的智能体实现一些功能。
Run it and let's let it implement some functionalities to our agent.

1972
02:38:13,934 --> 02:38:18,724
你可以看到它正在使用之前安装的 Manage deep 智能体 技能。
You can already see how it's using the Manage deep agent skill that it installed earlier.

1973
02:38:19,022 --> 02:38:25,508
很快，它停止并向我们提出了两个问题。它说这个脚手架不是一个管理的 deep 智能体 项目。
Quickly, it stops and asks us two questions. It says that the scaffold isn't a managed deep agent project.

1974
02:38:25,870 --> 02:38:27,940
它只是一个普通的 deep agents 快速启动项目。
It's just a plain deep agents quick start.

1975
02:38:28,590 --> 02:38:33,376
所以它需要安装两个包到里面，分别是 manage deep agents 和 Zod。
So it needs to install two packages into it, the manage deep agents and Zod.

1976
02:38:33,966 --> 02:38:36,804
然后它会把文件夹重构为管理的布局。
Then it will rework the folder into a managed layout.

1977
02:38:37,230 --> 02:38:39,652
没错，这正是我们想要做的。
Yep, this is exactly what we wanted to do.

1978
02:38:39,950 --> 02:38:42,404
其次，是图函数运行的地方。
Second, where the graph functions run.

1979
02:38:42,766 --> 02:38:45,136
它用带有 HTTP 客户端的六个工具。
It makes the six tools with HTTP clients.

1980
02:38:45,296 --> 02:38:49,924
每个工具都会将智能体的启动文件和指令发送到应用的只读端点。
Each tool sends the agent starting file and direction to the app's read-only endpoint.

1981
02:38:50,222 --> 02:38:54,468
另一种选择是让智能体导入 libgraph，但这会导致两个问题。
The alternative is having the agent import libgraph, but that breaks two things.

1982
02:38:54,816 --> 02:39:06,176
所以，第二点，我同意你的做法。而且有一点是我们的 Langsmith 项目目前有欧盟端点，但部署到美国的智能体只能用美国端点。
So, two, I agree with your approach. And there's a point about our current Langsmith project having an EU endpoint, but manage deep agents deployed to US only.

1983
02:39:06,446 --> 02:39:10,564
所以这绝对是我们需要注意并核实的地方，以确保正确部署。
So this is definitely something that we should pay attention to and check away to properly deploy it.

1984
02:39:11,118 --> 02:39:13,696
考虑到这一点，我们让智能体继续执行。
With that in mind, let's tell the agent to proceed.

1985
02:39:13,966 --> 02:39:14,656
搞定。
And there we go.

1986
02:39:14,830 --> 02:39:21,060
几分钟后，智能体项目及其六个工具已在 cartograph 智能体 文件夹中构建完成。
In a couple of minutes, the agent project and its six tools are now built in the cartograph agent folder.

1987
02:39:21,486 --> 02:39:23,652
但它们目前还没返回真实数据。
But they don't return real data yet.

1988
02:39:24,046 --> 02:39:28,996
它们调用的是应用的只读端点，这是下一个子阶段的内容，目前还不存在。
They call the app's read only endpoint, which is the next subphase and doesn't exist.

1989
02:39:29,454 --> 02:39:35,536
类型、工具检查、脚本和 md 构建全部通过，mda dev 已启动，并注册了 cartograph 图。
Types, tool check, script, and md a build all pass, mda dev started, and register the cartograph graph.

1990
02:39:35,696 --> 02:39:38,916
但还没有任何问题通过处理，因为智能体密钥是空的。
But no question has gone through it because the agent keys are empty.

1991
02:39:39,790 --> 02:39:41,924
那么，我们现在在讨论什么？
So, what are we talking about here?

1992
02:39:42,286 --> 02:39:47,684
嗯，一个使用 OpenAI GPT-5.5 作为模型的托管深度智能体项目。
Well, a managed deep agent project with OpenAI GPT-5.5 as the model.

1993
02:39:48,270 --> 02:39:51,936
instructions.md 文件包含了规则并查阅所有相关内容。
Instructions MD holds the rules and look up everything.

1994
02:39:52,238 --> 02:39:56,976
不要从关联中推断，拒绝低质量问题，并告知它能回答什么。
Never infer from a connection, decline quality questions, and say what it can answer instead.

1995
02:39:57,166 --> 02:39:58,736
不要谈论它自己的内部机制。
Don't talk about its own internals.

1996
02:39:58,958 --> 02:40:02,884
好的，当我们查看那个 instructions 文件时，会详细审查所有这些内容。
Okay, we'll review all of this in detail when we check out that instructions file.

1997
02:40:03,342 --> 02:40:11,044
然后在 tools 图 中有六个工具：摘要、路径搜索、按角色查找文件、邻居、遍历和路由。
Then there are six tools in tools graph for summary, path search, files by role, neighbors, a walk, and routes.

1998
02:40:11,470 --> 02:40:17,380
每个工具都会收到一个 GET 请求，如果查询失败，会返回“查询失败”，而绝不会给出一个编造的答案。
Each tool gets a GET request, and a failed lookup comes back as lookup failed and never a made-up answer.

1999
02:40:17,774 --> 02:40:23,076
它还创建了一个脚本，允许我们检查这三个工具以及它实施的其他一些更改。
It also created a script allowing us to check all of these three tools and some other changes that it implemented.

2000
02:40:23,456 --> 02:40:33,456
目前，我们只需要将 OpenAI API 密钥和 Langsmith API 密钥填入 cartograph 的 ENV 中，这两个目前都是空的，然后我们就可以运行 mda dev 了。
For now, we just need to pass over the OpenAI API key as well as the Langsmith API key into the cartograph ENVs, both of which are empty, and then we can run MDA dev.

2001
02:40:33,856 --> 02:40:39,456
幸好，我们在当前的 projects.env.local 文件中已经有了这两个环境变量。
Thankfully, we already have both of these ENVs under our current projects.env.local.

2002
02:40:39,662 --> 02:40:48,804
所以我们需要获取 OpenAI API 密钥和 Langsmith API 密钥，进入 cartograph 智能体 并把它们粘贴到这里。
So we need to grab the OpenAI API key as well as the Langsmith API key, head over into cartograph agent and paste them right here.

2003
02:40:49,456 --> 02:40:54,404
Langsmith API 密钥就是这个。
The Langsmith API key is this one right here.

2004
02:40:55,150 --> 02:40:59,216
然后 OpenAI API 密钥是从这里获取的。
And then the OpenAI API key is coming from here.

2005
02:40:59,502 --> 02:41:02,692
现在让我们来看看 Cartograph Agent 内部到底发生了什么。
So now let's review what actually happened within Cartograph Agent.

2006
02:41:02,816 --> 02:41:06,084
首先，我们想看看 智能体.ts 文件。
First, we want to look into the agent.ts file.

2007
02:41:06,382 --> 02:41:08,496
在这里你可以看到我们智能体的结构。
Here you can see the structure of our agent.

2008
02:41:08,782 --> 02:41:10,500
我们正在定义深度智能体
We're defining the deep agent

2009
02:41:11,758 --> 02:41:19,536
名称为 Cartograph，运行这个模型并使用这些图工具，包括摘要、搜索文件，
with the name of Cartograph, running this model and using these graph tools, including summarize, search files,

2010
02:41:19,758 --> 02:41:22,788
按角色查找文件、邻居、遍历和路由。
files by role, neighbors, walk, and routes.

2011
02:41:23,118 --> 02:41:26,564
如果你想查看这些工具，你可以看看目前的情况。
And if you want to check out some of these tools, you can see what's happening.

2012
02:41:47,534 --> 02:41:55,524
还有我提到的 instructions.md 文件，里面进一步解释了这个智能体应该如何表现。
There's also the instructions.md file that I mentioned, where we further explain how this agent should behave.

2013
02:41:55,776 --> 02:42:03,696
如果你进入 tools 目录，你会看到 API 以及定义这些工具的 图.ts。
And if you head over into tools, you'll see that we have the API as well as the graph.ts where those tools are defined.

2014
02:42:03,950 --> 02:42:09,540
但目前虽然智能体已经存在，但因为它是一个独立的服务，所以它还无法读取任何内容。
But right now, even though the agent exists, it can't read anything yet, as it's a separate service.

2015
02:42:09,902 --> 02:42:12,612
所以它必须通过 HTTP 回传给我们。
So it has to come back to us over HTTP.

2016
02:42:13,326 --> 02:42:14,500
这就是下一个重点。
And that's the next point.

2017
02:42:15,022 --> 02:42:15,972
打开 Claude。
Open up Claude.

2018
02:42:16,302 --> 02:42:26,816
在这种情况下，你可以打开之前那个相同的 Claude 对话，我们让它进行第二轮处理，告诉它去读取这些工具的 HTTP 端点
And in this case, you can open up the same Claud conversation from before, and we can run it on a second pass by telling it to now read the HTTP endpoints for those tools

2019
02:42:27,086 --> 02:42:32,016
以及包含分析项目和组织的短效签名凭证。
and the short-lived signed credentials that names one analysis and its organization.

2020
02:42:32,238 --> 02:42:33,476
那让它开始处理吧。
So let's let it work on it.

2021
02:42:33,776 --> 02:42:38,980
很快，端点和凭证就构建好了，构建过程很干净。
And very quickly, the endpoints and the credential are built and the build is clean.

2022
02:42:39,374 --> 02:42:43,696
这些端点响应来自画布和面板所使用的相同图函数。
The endpoints answer from the same graph functions the canvas and the pane use.

2023
02:42:43,918 --> 02:42:48,644
它直接用 SQL 测试了数据库策略，但还没有进行端到端的凭证测试。
It tested the database policies directly in SQL, but haven't run the credential end-to-end yet.

2024
02:42:48,816 --> 02:42:52,548
那需要一个我们需要导入到 Superbase 的签名密钥。
That needs a signing key that we have to import into Superbase.

2025
02:42:52,814 --> 02:43:01,828
所以它要求我们运行 PMPM 智能体 check，我们可以通过打开终端来操作，它告诉了我们要添加到 .env.local 的哪一行。
So it's asking us to run PmPM agent key, which we can do by opening the terminal, and it's telling us which line to add to the.env.local.

2026
02:43:02,016 --> 02:43:06,788
我相信这就是属于原始项目的那个 env.local。
I believe that is this env.local belonging to the original project.

